{"id":"vol8-03","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-03/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":457.04,"segments":[{"start":5.28,"end":12.36,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions and you will have a chance to","words":[["There",5.28,6.06],["will",6.06,6.84],["be",6.84,7.0],["time",7.0,7.32],["for",7.32,7.62],["you",7.62,7.78],["to",7.78,7.92],["read",7.92,8.2],["the",8.2,8.38],["instructions",8.38,9.0],["and",9.0,9.62],["questions",9.62,10.12],["and",10.12,11.28],["you",11.28,11.42],["will",11.42,11.52],["have",11.52,11.68],["a",11.68,11.8],["chance",11.8,12.12],["to",12.12,12.36]]},{"start":12.36,"end":17.6,"text":"check your work. All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["check",12.36,12.7],["your",12.7,13.02],["work.",13.02,13.46],["All",14.24,15.0],["the",15.0,15.16],["recordings",15.16,15.54],["will",15.54,15.96],["be",15.96,16.12],["played",16.12,16.52],["once",16.52,16.98],["only.",16.98,17.6]]},{"start":18.64,"end":26.48,"text":"The test is in four sections. Write all your answers in the listening question booklet. At","words":[["The",18.64,19.12],["test",19.12,19.58],["is",19.58,19.88],["in",19.88,20.06],["four",20.06,20.32],["sections.",20.32,20.84],["Write",21.66,22.2],["all",22.2,22.5],["your",22.5,22.62],["answers",22.62,23.14],["in",23.14,23.56],["the",23.56,23.72],["listening",23.72,24.04],["question",24.04,24.68],["booklet.",24.68,25.1],["At",25.92,26.48]]},{"start":26.48,"end":31.72,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to an","words":[["At",26.48,26.48],["the",26.48,26.6],["end",26.6,26.8],["of",26.8,26.92],["the",26.92,27.0],["test,",27.0,27.38],["you",27.88,28.16],["will",28.16,28.3],["be",28.3,28.44],["given",28.44,28.68],["10",28.68,29.06],["minutes",29.06,29.3],["to",29.3,29.86],["transfer",29.86,30.48],["your",30.48,30.78],["answers",30.78,31.26],["to",31.26,31.56],["an",31.56,31.72]]},{"start":31.72,"end":32.36,"text":"answer sheet.","words":[["answer",31.72,32.0],["sheet.",32.0,32.36]]},{"start":34.42,"end":39.42,"text":"Now turn to section 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",34.42,34.84],["turn",34.84,35.14],["to",35.14,35.34],["section",35.34,35.66],["1",35.66,36.16],["on",36.16,36.82],["page",36.82,37.14],["2",37.14,37.74],["of",37.74,38.32],["your",38.32,38.5],["question",38.5,38.92],["booklet.",38.92,39.42]]},{"start":44.76,"end":45.58,"text":"Section 1.","words":[["Section",44.76,45.04],["1.",45.04,45.58]]},{"start":46.44,"end":53.28,"text":"You will hear a telephone conversation between a travel agent and a man who needs help planning","words":[["You",46.44,46.8],["will",46.8,46.98],["hear",46.98,47.2],["a",47.2,47.46],["telephone",47.46,47.84],["conversation",47.84,48.78],["between",48.78,49.54],["a",49.54,49.82],["travel",49.82,50.12],["agent",50.12,50.54],["and",50.54,51.28],["a",51.28,51.46],["man",51.46,51.66],["who",51.66,51.92],["needs",51.92,52.22],["help",52.22,52.64],["planning",52.64,53.28]]},{"start":53.28,"end":53.86,"text":"a holiday.","words":[["a",53.28,53.48],["holiday.",53.48,53.86]]},{"start":54.98,"end":60.58,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 1 to 7 on page 2.","words":[["First,",54.98,55.4],["you",55.94,56.08],["have",56.08,56.24],["some",56.24,56.44],["time",56.44,56.78],["to",56.78,57.0],["look",57.0,57.12],["at",57.12,57.26],["questions",57.26,57.58],["1",57.58,58.24],["to",58.24,58.58],["7",58.58,59.02],["on",59.02,59.68],["page",59.68,60.0],["2.",60.0,60.58]]},{"start":60.58,"end":99.13,"text":"You will see that there is an example that has been done for you.","words":[["You",60.58,60.74],["will",60.74,61.58],["see",96.23,96.51],["that",96.51,96.71],["there",96.71,96.87],["is",96.87,97.01],["an",97.01,97.13],["example",97.13,97.65],["that",97.65,97.89],["has",97.89,98.03],["been",98.03,98.23],["done",98.23,98.49],["for",98.49,98.87],["you.",98.87,99.13]]},{"start":99.75,"end":105.61,"text":"On this occasion only, the conversation relating to this will be played first.","words":[["On",99.75,100.07],["this",100.07,100.45],["occasion",100.45,100.97],["only,",100.97,101.55],["the",102.17,102.33],["conversation",102.33,102.85],["relating",102.85,103.47],["to",103.47,103.81],["this",103.81,104.07],["will",104.07,104.51],["be",104.51,104.69],["played",104.69,105.17],["first.",105.17,105.61]]},{"start":109.13,"end":110.85,"text":"Beach Heads Travel Pam speaking.","words":[["Beach",109.13,109.47],["Heads",109.47,109.71],["Travel",109.71,110.03],["Pam",110.03,110.39],["speaking.",110.39,110.85]]},{"start":111.55,"end":116.73,"text":"Hi, my name's Duncan. I'm hoping you'll be able to help me organize a trip to Beach Heads.","words":[["Hi,",111.55,111.83],["my",112.23,112.35],["name's",112.35,112.65],["Duncan.",112.65,112.89],["I'm",113.41,113.59],["hoping",113.59,113.87],["you'll",113.87,114.11],["be",114.11,114.23],["able",114.23,114.39],["to",114.39,114.55],["help",114.55,114.71],["me",114.71,114.87],["organize",114.87,115.29],["a",115.29,115.59],["trip",115.59,115.77],["to",115.77,116.01],["Beach",116.01,116.23],["Heads.",116.23,116.73]]},{"start":117.33,"end":121.31,"text":"Sure, let me just fill in our customer request sheet while I'm speaking to you.","words":[["Sure,",117.33,117.79],["let",117.95,118.07],["me",118.07,118.19],["just",118.19,118.45],["fill",118.45,118.61],["in",118.61,118.77],["our",118.77,118.95],["customer",118.95,119.27],["request",119.27,119.71],["sheet",119.71,120.19],["while",120.19,120.41],["I'm",120.41,120.55],["speaking",120.55,120.85],["to",120.85,121.09],["you.",121.09,121.31]]},{"start":122.15,"end":123.61,"text":"Could you tell me your name again, please?","words":[["Could",122.15,122.35],["you",122.35,122.47],["tell",122.47,122.59],["me",122.59,122.71],["your",122.71,122.81],["name",122.81,122.95],["again,",122.95,123.21],["please?",123.21,123.61]]},{"start":124.25,"end":126.73,"text":"Yes, it's Duncan. Duncan White.","words":[["Yes,",124.25,124.55],["it's",124.73,1